{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/305736-idea-for-an-npc-need-advice","id":305736,"title":"Idea for an NPC, need advice","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-07T08:11:08-08:00","id":305736,"title":"Idea for an NPC, need advice","content":"I'm creating an NPC Demon for my chronicle. He's got the Going Native Embed, and his greatest desire is to become human one day, because he is in love with humanity and its cultures.<br /> <br /> Could you suggest how to develop this NPC for his sheet? Like...Embeds, Exploits and Demonic form?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T11:37:16-08:00","id":306000,"title":"","content":"the same process as character creation for a regular Demon? If you feel the need to give him a full sheet, I mean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T14:35:20-08:00","id":306139,"title":"","content":"Yes, I was asking for suggestion for what kind of embeds/exploit/demonic forms could fit. I don't have a precise idea of what this character might be, or even what Incarnation or Agenda it could be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T15:43:25-08:00","id":306176,"title":"","content":"Ok first think about who he is. The mission is what makes a demon who they are, to start with. They see the world through their mission. It's why wheels can end up seeing people as parts to fit together because people were resources. The catalyst is what breaks that perception. It is also a big impact in what makes the character.<br /> <br /> Now I feel it wyld be too easy to say it was his mission that made him want to be human. Imagine this. He fell hating the god machine. Hard core sabatour. Fought so long he has lost the fight spirit. Wants to do away with the war and just be human. Here us the hook. The players need to get to a certain infrastructure. Only people who know where it is and how to get in is that demon. They might be able to convince him to say where it is but without getting him to help them get in to the place chance of surviving is near 0<br /> <br /> Also an angel is a took. What was his mission. What would he need to get it done. Every for if primum u can switch out a form for an other. So if he has a bit of primum then mind reading to keen how humans think. <br /> <br /> I wouldn't give him more than the 4 u get at the beginning. He invests in skills and merits. Other than his interlocks which might think might give him the answer to begun human. I would even make his dial truth about having to accept who he is as a demon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4090,"user